      <p begin="00:05.250" end="00:08.430" ttm:agent="v1">I'm feeling sexy and free</p>
      <p begin="00:08.430" end="00:11.610" ttm:agent="v1">Like glitter's raining on me</p>
      <p begin="00:11.610" end="00:14.530" ttm:agent="v1">You're like a shot of pure gold</p>
      <p begin="00:14.530" end="00:18.790" ttm:agent="v1">I think I'm about to explode</p>
      <p begin="00:18.790" end="00:21.980" ttm:agent="v1">I can taste the tension like a cloud of smoke in the air</p>
      <p begin="00:21.980" end="00:24.850" ttm:agent="v1">Now I'm breathing like I'm running, 'cause you're taking me there</p>
      <p begin="00:24.850" end="00:27.140" ttm:agent="v1">Don't you know</p>
